  "html": "<table cellpadding=\"5\" style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left; max-width: 300px;\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#CC0033; color:#FFFFFF;\"> SuperCrew\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"> <a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Guild-_SuperCrew.jpg\" title=\"Guild- SuperCrew.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"194\" src=\"/images/Guild-_SuperCrew.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Leader\n</th><td> Syjumik\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Officers\n</th><td> Neomatrix, CindyC, AkumaChan\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> No. of members\n</th><td> Many, and growing fast!\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> VoIP\n</th><td> No\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Language\n</th><td> English\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Time zone\n</th><td> Usually most active evenings US time\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Guild_Overview\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Guild Overview </span></h2>\n<p>SuperCrew is a very active posse for players (of whatever age) that can act in a mature fashion.  The L100s are very helpful but it is not permitted to be importunate!  Many guild members are active PvP players and there is friendly competition within the posse at times!\n</p>\n<a name=\"Latest_News\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Latest News </span></h2>\n<p>See pictures of some of our guild members at <a href=\"/wiki/Screenshots\" title=\"Screenshots\">Screenshots</a>!  --<a href=\"/wiki/User/Catwalksbyhimself\" title=\"User:Catwalksbyhimself\">Catwalksbyhimself</a> 01:02, 26 February 2009 (CET)\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Members\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Members </span></h2>\n<p>We have many members of all levels, and are constantly growing.  If you would like an invitation, run for a while with a member and if you play well and maturely you can get invited.\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Supercrew_roster.jpg\" title=\"Image:Supercrew_roster.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Supercrew_roster.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"1107\" src=\"/images/Supercrew_roster.jpg\" width=\"441\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
